abstract: >-
  Code, documented notebooks and outputs for a study of whether flash floods reduce
  Boro rice through harvested area rather than yield in Bangladesh, using the Gold
  panel of bd-boro-data-framework (10.5281/zenodo.23795046), flood fractions from
  Sentinel-1 and JRC, and a satellite measure of greenness loss.
keywords:
  - flood loss
  - flash flood
  - Boro rice
  - harvested area
  - Sentinel-1
  - Bangladesh
